      {
        "stage": 24,
        "statement": "Backwater causes Duck Creek and Frog Creek to threaten structures east of downtown Hobart. Main Street threatened near 3rd Street in Hobart."
      },
      {
        "stage": 21.5,
        "statement": "Structures threatened along Old Ridge Road in Hobart."
      },
      {
        "stage": 21,
        "statement": "Multiple structures threatened along Main Street in downtown Hobart. A few residences threatened along Lake Park Avenue in Hobart. Rand Street threatened in Hobart."
      },
      {
        "stage": 20.5,
        "statement": "3rd Street threatened in Hobart."
      },
      {
        "stage": 19,
        "statement": "A few structures threatened along Main Street in downtown Hobart including the Hobart Branch Library. Hobart Street (US-6) threatened north of Hobart. Old Ridge Road, Lake Park Avenue, and 37th Avenue threatened in Hobart."
      },
      {
        "stage": 14,
        "statement": "Parking lots threatened along Main Street in Hobart. Wisconsin Street threatened in Hobart. Low-lying portions of Festival Park threatened in Hobart. Backwater causes Duck Creek to threaten athletic fields at the Hobart Community Center"
      },
      {
        "stage": 12,
        "statement": "Water overtops low-lying banks at Lakefront Park in Hobart."
      },
      {
        "stage": 10,
